10. It is the Respondent’s position that the Claimant’s claim is inadequately pleaded. Specifically, 
the Respondent requests the Claimant is ordered to provide Further and Better Particulars in 
respect of his discrimination claims, including but not limited to: 
10.1 specific dates; 
10.2 persons involved; 
10.3 comparators (where applicable); 
10.4 description of act, incident, or treatment; 
10.5 what section of the EqA each alleged incident is said to be in breach of;  
10.6 what the protected act is;  
10.7 in respect of allegations of race discrimination state what the specific race that the 
Claimant relies upon.   
